  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49178aafbe2356d6",
      "translationZh": "简单介绍一下背景：LocalLightChat（LLC）是一个面向本地大语言模型的聊天前端。下载，运行，就这么简单。无需安装（除非你想安装），没有依赖，而且几乎什么设备都能运行，包括老古董硬件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c656385f920bdb83",
      "translationZh": "我最初开发它，是因为总觉得 Open WebUI 比我运行的模型还要笨重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0006197e1a6df9f9",
      "translationZh": "你们给我的主要批评之一，是它缺少智能体、MCP 和 RAG。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02b8b815d19521f7",
      "translationZh": "不过，现在情况变了。这三项都已集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38756b58426f4718",
      "translationZh": "我花了很多功夫，尽可能提高智能体系统的 token 使用效率。得益于多项优化，即使使用较小的上下文窗口，它也能流畅地处理大文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "057280f50a2d32f3",
      "translationZh": "此外，还集成了一个 RAG 系统，与 Qwen3 等嵌入模型配合使用效果很好（附有配置说明）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10ffbea655294350",
      "translationZh": "一个可独立运行的 NPX Supergateway 替代方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95ed2e8240a23b16",
      "translationZh": "通过 ComfyUI 编辑图像，并自动检测所有主流图像模型的绑定关系。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5005a86246457dce",
      "translationZh": "做到这一切的同时，并没有把 LLC 变成我最初想要摆脱的那种重量级应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "575874e9b3a1b020",
      "translationZh": "我很想听听你的看法，尤其是如果你试用过早期版本！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a889add7410958e",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/PromptInjection_ 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
